    ["<Assistant_Title1>【爱的方向】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>诊所的霍普医生最近总是眉头紧锁，似乎在为什么事情困扰。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>晋升至序列8，前往{Location:[廷根(904,1070)]|-9570;7006;-1822;2;5200002;0}与<Assistant_Red>霍普</>对话接取任务。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励：</>认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Direction of Love】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Description: </> Dr. Hope at the clinic has been frowning lately, seemingly troubled by something. \n<Assistant_Title2> How to Accept: </> Advance to Sequence 8, head to {Location: [Tingen (904,1070)] | -9570;7006;-1822;2;5200002;0 } and speak with <Assistant_Red>Hope</> to accept the quest. \n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Rewards: </> Cognition EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【风暴追逐】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>介绍：</>竞速，是风暴的缩影。驾驭蒸汽车疾驰于街巷，乘风破浪冲过险滩，借灵性之跃腾空飞跃追逐风暴之主的脚步，赢取独属于你的荣耀与馈赠。\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法指引：</>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. 寻找风暴追逐</>\n可通过以下任一方式前往玩法：\n<Assistant_Property2>跑团入口：</>打开菜单进入【跑团】，加入任意教团后，在【秩序世界】中选择【风暴追逐】，点击【前往】即可自动寻路。\n<Assistant_Property1>地图入口：</>打开地图，切换至【探秘】页签，在【世界详情】中查看【风暴追逐】玩法图标，并根据图标指引在地图中找到对应标识，点击【前往】即可自动寻路。\n<Assistant_Title3>2. 发起挑战</>\n到达目标地点后，与竞速爱好者对话，选择开启竞速挑战。\n<Assistant_Title3>3. 完成竞速</>\n进入竞速位面后，根据路线指引前进，在倒计时结束前抵达终点即可完成挑战。\n<Assistant_Title1>【助手提示】</>\n触碰<Assistant_Property1>白色光圈</>可获得加速效果。\n触碰<Assistant_Red>红色光圈</>受到减速效果，建议尽量避开。\n挑战失败后可重新发起挑战！"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Storm Chasing】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Introduction: </>Racing is the epitome of a storm. Drive your steam car at full speed through the streets, ride the waves across dangerous shoals, and use the Leap of Spirituality to soar through the air as you follow in the footsteps of the Lord of Storms to win the glory and gifts that belong only to you.\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Guide: </>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. Finding Storm Chasing</>\nYou can navigate to this activity using either of the following methods:\n<Assistant_Property2>TTRPG Entry:</>Open the Menu, enter [TTRPG], join any organization, select [Storm Chasing] in the [Orderly World], and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Property1>Map Entry:</>Open the map, switch to the [Exploration] tab, view the [Storm Chasing] icon in [World Details], find the corresponding marker on the map based on the icon's guidance, and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Title3>2. Initiating a Challenge</>\nAfter arriving at the target location, speak with the racing enthusiast to start the racing challenge.\n<Assistant_Title3>3. Completing the Race</>\nAfter entering the racing plane, follow the route markers and reach the finish line before the countdown ends to complete the challenge.\n<Assistant_Title1>【Assistant Tip】</>\nTouch the <Assistant_Property1>white ring</> to gain an acceleration effect.\nTouch the <Assistant_Red>red ring</> to receive a slow effect; it is recommended to avoid these.\nYou can restart the challenge if you fail!",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>征服之路</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>以战养战-势力\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>在猎城战中参与攻破王城城门一次"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Path of Conquest</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>War-Driven - Faction\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Participate in breaking through the Royal City Gate once in the Hunting City Battle",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>成为神！</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>以战养战-征伐\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>参与众神之巅玩法后取得冠军荣誉称号"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Become a God!</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Battle for Growth - Conquest\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Obtain the Champion honorary title after participating in Peak of the Gods",
