    ["提高伤害技能的技能基础值，受到目标技能抵挡的抵消。\n技能基础值不受<Highlight>攻击</>和<Highlight>防御</>影响，取决于<Highlight>技能系数</>和<Highlight>技能等级</>。\n修正后的技能基础值存在<Highlight>250%</>的上限和<Highlight>5%</>的下限，提升的技能增强超出上阈值或未到下阈值时，无法提升增伤能力。\n实际效果和阈值取决于攻防双方<Highlight>等级</>、与对方<Highlight>技能抵挡</>属性的对抗结算。"] = "Increases the base Skill value of damage skills, offset by the target's Skill Block. \n The base Skill value is not affected by <Highlight> Attack </> and <Highlight> Defense </>, but depends on <Highlight> Skill Coefficient </> and <Highlight> Skill Level </>. \n The corrected base Skill value has an upper limit of <Highlight> 250% </> and a lower limit of <Highlight> 5% </>; if the increased Skill Enhancement exceeds the upper threshold or fails to reach the lower threshold, it cannot improve damage boosting capability. \n The actual effect and thresholds depend on the Level <Highlight> </> of both the attacker and defender, and the confrontation settlement with the opponent's <Highlight> Skill Block </> attribute.",
